- 脚疼 (jiǎoténg;) - foot hurts
- 脱衣服 (tuō) - yī fú take off clothes
- 脱鞋 (tuō) - xié take off shoes
- 艮 (gèn) - stopping
- 艹 (cǎo) - grass - 花 flower (huā), 菜 vegetable (cài)
- 英文 (Yīngwén) - English
- 苹果 (píngguǒ) - apple
- 菠萝 (bōluó;) - pineapple
- 虫 (chóng) - insect
- 衤 (yī) - clothes - 裙 skirt (qún), 衫 shirt (shān)
- 西 (xī) - west
- 西班⽛ (Xībānyá) - Spain
- 覀 (xī) - west (top)
- 要 (yào) - to be going to
- 见 (jiàn) - see
- 解冻 (jiě) - dòng thaw
- 讠 (yán) - speech (side)
- 讠(訁) (yán) - word, language, speech - 说 say (shuō), 语 language (yǔ)
- 话 (huà) - word; speech
- 请 (qǐng) - please
- 请你读 (Qǐng) - nǐ dú please read
- 请你选择一个 (Qǐng) - nǐ xuǎnzé yīgè please choose one
- 读书 (dúshū) - to study; to read books
- 读这些词 (dú) - zhèxiē cí read these words
- 课 (kè) - class, lesson
- 谁 (shéi/shuí) - who
- 豕 (shǐ) - pig
- 贝 (bèi) - shell, money
- 走路 (zǒu) - lù walk
- 跟家人视频 (gēn) - jiā rén shì pín video call with family
- 身 (shēn) - body
- 躲雨 (duǒ) - yǔ take shelter from the rain
- 车 (chē) - car
- 车 (車) (chē) - car, vehicle, cart - 车 car (chē), 軌 rail/track (guǐ)
- 辶 (chuò) - walk, movement (side)
- 过马路 (guò) - mǎ lù cross the street
- 这 (zhè) - this
- 这么/那么 (zhème) - / nàme so (expensive, far, etc.)
- 这只狗 (zhè) - zhī gǒu this dog
- 送外卖 (sòng) - wàimài to deliver food; food delivery
- 那 (nà) - that
- 那我们继续 (nà) - wǒmen jìxù then let’s continue
- 那本书 (nà) - běn shū that book
- 酉 (yǒu) - wine, 10th branch
- 酒吧 (jiǔ) - bā bar, pub
- 醒来 (xǐng) - lái wake up
- 釆 (biàn) - distinguish, divide
- 钅 (jīn) - metal (side)
- 钅(釒) (jīn) - metal - 银 silver (yín), 铁 iron (tiě)
- 长 (cháng) - long
- 门 (mén) - door
- 门 (門) (mén) - door - 间 room (jiān), 闭 shut (bì)
- 问题 (wèn) - tí question, problem
- 阝 (yì) - terrain, hill, city, town - 部 department/section (bù), 都 both (bōu)
- 院 (yuàn) - courtyard; institution; place
- 陪 (péi) - to accompany; go with someone
- 随便 (suí) - biàn casual, careless, to do as one pleases
- 随便你 (suíbiàn) - nǐ it's up to you / do as you wish
- 隹 (zhuī) - short-tailed bird
- 难 (nán) - - difficult
- 难过 (nán) - guò sad; feeling down
- 雨 (yǔ) - rain
- 青 (qīng) - blue-green
- 非 (fēi) - wrong, not
- 音 (yīn) - sound
- 页 (yè) - page, head
- 饣 (shí) - food (side)
- 饣(飠) (shí) - food, eat - 饭 rice/meal (fàn), 饮 drink (yǐn)
- 馆 (guǎn) - hall; building; place
- 首 (shǒu) - measure word for songs, poems, etc.
- 马 (mǎ) - horse
- 鱼 (魚) (yú) - fish - 鲜 fresh (xiān), 鮑 abalone (bào)
- 鸟 (niǎo) - bird
- 鸡 (jī) - chicken
- 鸡蛋 (jīdàn) - egg
- 龰 (zú) - foot (bottom)
- 龴 (xíng) - go (component)
- 龵 (shǒu) - hand (top)
